#. module: spreadsheet_forecast_oca
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet_forecast_oca/static/src/spreadsheet/bundle/forecast_functions.esm.js:0
msgid ""
"Averages the most recent numeric values of a range (simple moving average)."
msgstr ""
"Berekent het gemiddelde van de meest recente numerieke waarden van een "
"bereik (eenvoudig voortschrijdend gemiddelde)."

#. module: spreadsheet_forecast_oca
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet_forecast_oca/static/src/spreadsheet/bundle/forecast_functions.esm.js:0
msgid ""
"How many of the last values to average, e.g. 3. A window larger than the "
"number of values averages all of them."
msgstr ""
"Het aantal laatste waarden waarvan het gemiddelde berekend wordt, bijv. 3. "
"Een venster dat groter is dan het aantal waarden, neemt het gemiddelde van "
"alle waarden."

#. module: spreadsheet_forecast_oca
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet_forecast_oca/static/src/spreadsheet/bundle/forecast_functions.esm.js:0
msgid ""
"Predicts the y value at a given x from a least-squares linear regression of "
"known data."
msgstr ""
"Voorspelt de y-waarde bij een gegeven x op basis van een lineaire regressie "
"(kleinste kwadraten) van bekende gegevens."

#. module: spreadsheet_forecast_oca
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet_forecast_oca/static/src/spreadsheet/bundle/forecast_functions.esm.js:0
msgid ""
"Returns the value of the least-squares trend line at a new x. When all "
"known_x values are identical, returns the average of known_y."
msgstr ""
"Geeft de waarde van de trendlijn (kleinste kwadraten) bij een nieuwe x. Als "
"alle known_x-waarden gelijk zijn, wordt het gemiddelde van known_y "
"teruggegeven."

#. module: spreadsheet_forecast_oca
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet_forecast_oca/static/src/spreadsheet/bundle/forecast_functions.esm.js:0
msgid "The known values, e.g. past sales."
msgstr "De bekende waarden, bijv. eerdere verkopen."

#. module: spreadsheet_forecast_oca
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet_forecast_oca/static/src/spreadsheet/bundle/forecast_functions.esm.js:0
msgid "The values to average. Blank and non-numeric cells are skipped."
msgstr ""
"De waarden waarvan het gemiddelde berekend wordt. Lege en niet-numerieke "
"cellen worden overgeslagen."

#. module: spreadsheet_forecast_oca
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet_forecast_oca/static/src/spreadsheet/bundle/forecast_functions.esm.js:0
msgid "The x value to evaluate the trend line at."
msgstr "De x-waarde waarop de trendlijn berekend wordt."

#. module: spreadsheet_forecast_oca
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet_forecast_oca/static/src/spreadsheet/bundle/forecast_functions.esm.js:0
msgid "The x value to predict y for, e.g. the next month number."
msgstr ""
"De x-waarde waarvoor y voorspeld wordt, bijv. het nummer van de volgende "
"maand."

#. module: spreadsheet_forecast_oca
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet_forecast_oca/static/src/spreadsheet/bundle/forecast_functions.esm.js:0
msgid "The x values paired row by row with known_y, e.g. the month numbers."
msgstr ""
"De x-waarden die rij voor rij bij known_y horen, bijv. de maandnummers."

#. module: spreadsheet_forecast_oca
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet_forecast_oca/static/src/spreadsheet/bundle/forecast_functions.esm.js:0
msgid ""
"[[FUNCTION_NAME]] cannot fit a trend line because all known_x values are "
"identical. Use at least two different x values."
msgstr ""
"[[FUNCTION_NAME]] kan geen trendlijn berekenen omdat alle known_x-waarden "
"gelijk zijn. Gebruik minstens twee verschillende x-waarden."

#. module: spreadsheet_forecast_oca
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet_forecast_oca/static/src/spreadsheet/bundle/forecast_functions.esm.js:0
msgid "[[FUNCTION_NAME]] expects a window of at least 1, but got %s."
msgstr "[[FUNCTION_NAME]] verwacht een venster van minstens 1, maar kreeg %s."

#. module: spreadsheet_forecast_oca
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet_forecast_oca/static/src/spreadsheet/bundle/forecast_functions.esm.js:0
msgid ""
"[[FUNCTION_NAME]] needs at least 2 rows where both known_x and known_y are "
"numbers. Blank and non-numeric cells are skipped."
msgstr ""
"[[FUNCTION_NAME]] heeft minstens 2 rijen nodig waarin zowel known_x als "
"known_y een getal is. Lege en niet-numerieke cellen worden overgeslagen."

#. module: spreadsheet_forecast_oca
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet_forecast_oca/static/src/spreadsheet/bundle/forecast_functions.esm.js:0
msgid ""
"[[FUNCTION_NAME]] needs at least one numeric value in the range. Blank and "
"non-numeric cells are skipped."
msgstr ""
"[[FUNCTION_NAME]] heeft minstens één numerieke waarde in het bereik nodig. "
"Lege en niet-numerieke cellen worden overgeslagen."

#. module: spreadsheet_forecast_oca
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet_forecast_oca/static/src/spreadsheet/bundle/forecast_functions.esm.js:0
msgid ""
"[[FUNCTION_NAME]]: known_x has %(x_count)s cells but known_y has "
"%(y_count)s. Select two ranges of the same size so every x value is paired "
"with its y value."
msgstr ""
"[[FUNCTION_NAME]]: known_x heeft %(x_count)s cellen, maar known_y heeft er "
"%(y_count)s. Selecteer twee even grote bereiken, zodat elke x-waarde aan de "
"bijbehorende y-waarde gekoppeld is."
